page('analytics.html','Measurement & campaign ledger',head('OPERATIONS','Measure before optimizing.','No traffic, click, order or revenue figures have been invented. An empty ledger is intentional.')+'<div class="notice"><strong>Live analytics: not enabled.</strong> The client and self-hosted collector are implemented; GitHub Pages is static and no collector URL is configured. There are no live click or conversion measurements yet.</div>'+table(['Proposed event','Trigger','Official context'],[[e,trigger,link('https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API','Browser API reference')] for e,trigger in zip(C['events'],['Page load','Guide load','Direct observed-product link click; never an order','Product category filter','RSS link click'])])+'''<div class="prose"><h2>Privacy by design</h2><p>The optional collector stores daily aggregate counts by allowlisted page and product only. No cookies, local storage, IP addresses, user agents, full URLs, search strings or referrers are stored by application code. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control are respected. There is no cross-device or individual attribution.</p><h2>Orders are a separate source</h2><p>An outbound click is not a sale. Eligible sessions and reported orders must come from authorized first-party reports with report references and dates. The browser never emits a purchase event. No conversion rate can be computed until an appropriate, compatible denominator and reporting window exist.</p></div>'''+table(['Timestamp','Source','Channel','Eligible sessions','Clicks','Reported orders','Provenance'],[])+'<p class="empty">No authorized campaign reports imported.</p><p><a href="data/campaigns.csv" download>Download the empty campaign ledger</a> · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy notes</a></p>')
